{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"angular","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana works with both ways of building Angular: the "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular CLI"}]},{"type":"text","value":", through two\nbuilders that replace Angular's own for building and serving, and "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Analog"}]},{"type":"text","value":" on\nVite, through a Vite plugin. Templates style elements with an "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-string\">[sx]</span>","source":"[sx]"}},{"type":"text","value":" directive.\nTested on every change by "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"examples/angular-cli","source":"examples/angular-cli"}},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"examples/analog-angular","source":"examples/analog-angular"}},{"type":"text","value":",\nwith npm and pnpm, in a production build and on the dev server."}]},{"type":"component","name":"npm-status","attributes":{},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"how-angular-differs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"How Angular differs"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Everywhere else, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"sx","source":"sx"}},{"type":"text","value":" is compiled away: the build writes the class names into the\nelement. An Angular template reaches only its component's members, so there the\nbuild compiles your "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-function\">css</span>({...})","source":"css({...})"}},{"type":"text","value":" calls into class strings, and the "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-string\">[sx]</span>","source":"[sx]"}},{"type":"text","value":"\ndirective merges them in the browser with Kirana's runtime, which is under 1 kB gzipped.\nThe stylesheet is still built ahead of time, and the classes are the same ones a\nJSX app would get. What moves to the browser is only the merge: which entry wins\nwhen two handles set the same property."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"the-fast-way","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The fast way"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In the project's root:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"npx kirana-style init","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style init","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It detects Angular and whether it builds with the CLI or Analog, shows every\nchange below as a diff, writes them once you say yes, and prints the install\ncommand ("},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-attr\">--install</span>","source":"--install"}},{"type":"text","value":" runs it). Then "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"<span class=\"th-token th-command\">npx</span> kirana-style doctor","source":"npx kirana-style doctor"}},{"type":"text","value":" checks the result."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"with-the-angular-cli","children":[{"type":"text","value":"With the Angular CLI"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-install","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Install"}]},{"type":"component","name":"install","attributes":{"packages":"@kirana-style/core @kirana-style/angular"},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-use-kirana-s-builders","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Use Kirana's builders"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"In "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"angular.json","source":"angular.json"}},{"type":"text","value":", swap the "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"build","source":"build"}},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"serve","source":"serve"}},{"type":"text","value":" builders. Every option stays as\nit is:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"{\n  \"projects\": {\n    \"app\": {\n      \"architect\": {\n        \"build\": {\n          \"builder\": \"@kirana-style/angular:application\",\n          \"options\": { \"browser\": \"src/main.ts\" }\n        },\n        \"serve\": {\n          \"builder\": \"@kirana-style/angular:dev-server\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}","lang":"json","html":"{\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;projects&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;app&quot;</span>: {\n      <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;architect&quot;</span>: {\n        <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;build&quot;</span>: {\n          <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;builder&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/angular:application&quot;</span>,\n          <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;options&quot;</span>: { <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;browser&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;src/main.ts&quot;</span> }\n        },\n        <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;serve&quot;</span>: {\n          <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;builder&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/angular:dev-server&quot;</span>\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}","file":"angular.json","title":"angular.json"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Angular compiles TypeScript from disk and has no hook to change a file first. So\nthe builders keep a compiled copy of "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"src/","source":"src/"}},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":".<span class=\"th-token th-property\">kirana</span>/","source":".kirana/"}},{"type":"text","value":", and hand Angular:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"that copy, through "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"fileReplacements","source":"fileReplacements"}},{"type":"text","value":";"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"the stylesheet, "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":".<span class=\"th-token th-property\">kirana</span>/kirana.<span class=\"th-token th-property\">css</span>","source":".kirana/kirana.css"}},{"type":"text","value":", in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"styles","source":"styles"}},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The dev server and watch builds update the copy as you edit. Ignore the folder:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":".kirana/","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">.kirana/</span>","variant":"terminal","file":".gitignore","title":".gitignore"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"There is no stylesheet import to add: the builders add it."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"with-analog","children":[{"type":"text","value":"With Analog"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"1-install-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"1. Install"}]},{"type":"component","name":"install","attributes":{"packages":"@kirana-style/core @kirana-style/angular","dev":"@kirana-style/vite"},"children":[]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"2-add-the-plugin","children":[{"type":"text","value":"2. Add the plugin"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana goes after Analog. Angular compiles each file from disk, and Kirana\ncompiles the JavaScript it emitted:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"import analog from \"@analogjs/platform\"\nimport { kiranaAngular } from \"@kirana-style/angular/vite\"\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\"\n\nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [analog(), kiranaAngular()],\n})","lang":"ts","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> analog <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@analogjs/platform&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">import</span> { kiranaAngular } <span class=\"th-token th-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;@kirana-style/angular/vite&quot;</span>\n<span class=\"th-tok